<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Listing 8: </span><span id="LST8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">EXISTS</span> incorrectly duplicates rows in Dolt.</figcaption>
